			href="<%=ctx%>/Payment/paymentMntDayWorker.do"><span
			class="nav-icon">□</span><span>급여입력/관리(일용직)</span></a><a
			class="nav-item <%="payroll-ledger".equals(activeKey) ? "active" : ""%>"
			href="<%=ctx%>/Payment/paymentRegisterList.do"><span
			class="nav-icon">□</span><span>급여대장</span></a><a
			class="nav-item <%="pay-slip".equals(activeKey) ? "active" : ""%>"
			href="<%=ctx%>/Payment/paymentPayslip.do"><span class="nav-icon">□</span><span>급여명세</span></a><a
			class="nav-item <%="employee-pay-history".equals(activeKey) ? "active" : ""%>"
			href="<%=ctx%>/Payment/paymentPayList.do"><span
			class="nav-icon">□</span><span>사원별 급여내역</span></a><a
			class="nav-item <%="transfer-request".equals(activeKey) ? "active" : ""%>"
			href="<%=ctx%>/Payment/paymenttransfer.do"><span
			class="nav-icon">□</span><span>給与振込申請</span></a><a
			class="nav-item <%="transfer-result".equals(activeKey) ? "active" : ""%>"
			href="<%=ctx%>/Payment/paymenttransferlist.do"><span
			class="nav-icon">□</span><span>給与振込結果照会</span></a><a
			class="nav-item <%="item-ledger".equals(activeKey) ? "active" : ""%>"
			href="<%=ctx%>/Payment/paymentPayItemPart.do"><span
			class="nav-icon">□</span><span>項目別台帳</span></a><a
			class="nav-item <%="insurance-deduction".equals(activeKey) ? "active" : ""%>"
			href="<%=ctx%>/Payment/fourinsureList.do"><span
			class="nav-icon">□</span><span>4大保険控除内訳</span></a>
